  "brief": {
    "zh": "在 43 回合内用脉冲让三台对手机器人停机，芽芽要留在场上。从容模式需要用同一份程序连过两卷胶片。紧张模式在第一卷胶片上对抗。一卷从上方开门，另一卷从下方开门。第 13 回合末换门，追击机可以穿过开着的门。",
    "en": "Tag out all 3 robots with pulses within 43 turns and keep Sprout running. In relaxed mode, clear both reels with the same program. Timed mode uses the first reel. One opens with the upper door unlocked and the other with the lower door unlocked. The door switches after turn 13. The roaming bot can pass through the open door."
